{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":370,"mirrow":false,"y":-52,"img":"chara027_1","addImg":"chara027_1_face_chara027_1a"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":370,"mirrow":false,"y":-52,"img":"chara027_1","addImg":"chara027_1_face_chara027_1a"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]可爱，可爱，啾～啾～碰！欢迎回家！这是梅莉莉的爱心祝福哦！[r]是想先吃饭，先洗澡，还是——[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara027_1_face_chara027_1c"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]呃，你问这个是什么啊……开头就说了嘛，这是我专门为你进行的爱心祝福啊。[r]我练习了好久好久呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]唔，从哪里学的……姑且是大市集的那些女仆们传授给我的啦……好像那边的客人都很喜欢被这样服务，我就想稍微按你的喜好改一改，看看你喜不喜欢……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara027_1_face_chara027_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]唔～不知为什么，一对你做出这个姿势，我就觉得特别害羞，好像……做了什么大胆的事呢……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]你说也有同感？很喜欢？嘿嘿……那就好！[r]总、总之，这就是我为你专门准备的爱心祝福，以后每天见到你回家都会这么做，是只属于你的服务哦！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]唔～还、还是感觉……好羞耻啊……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"梅莉莉-亲密3","script":"yd_027_09"}